            </connector>
            <label>Is Not Null</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>06/04/26 (GD) – DLRS-replacement: Tracking_to_Loaner_Record (on update, synchronous). No delimiter — tracking numbers concatenated directly with no separator (deviates from org comma standard). No CONTAINS-based dedup implemented (dedup pattern requires a comma delimiter to work safely). Known gap: if Loaner__c changes to null, old parent is not recalculated (org-wide pattern). Revisit delimiter and dedup in a future iteration.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Loaner_Changed_Formula</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>NOT({!$Record.Loaner__c} = {!$Record__Prior.Loaner__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Trimmed_Tracking</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!Concatenated_Tracking}, 255)</expression>
    </formulas>
